FIFO Design (Verilog + VHDL)

This project implements a Synchronous FIFO (First-In First-Out) memory using both Verilog and VHDL.

📌 Description

FIFO is used to store data temporarily and ensures data is read in the same order it is written (First In, First Out).

⚙️ Features
Parameterized FIFO (data width & depth)
Write and Read operations
Full and Empty flag generation
Pointer-based memory access
Count-based tracking
📂 Files
Verilog implementation
VHDL implementation
Testbench files
